## Deletion Method
Problem encountered: Windows MAX_PATH (260 char) limit blocked Remove-Item and plain rmdir /s /q.
Solution: robocopy mirror trick
  1. Create empty temp directory
  2. robocopy /MIR empty → target (empties the target, bypasses MAX_PATH)
  3. cmd /c rmdir /s /q on now-empty target

